const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"单家机构风险与系统联动分开",en:"Separate standalone risk from systemic dependence"},body:{zh:"Adrian与Brunnermeier从单家机构的VaR出发，追问它处于困境时，整个金融系统的损失分布怎样变化。一家机构自身波动很大，未必与其他机构共同承压；多家小机构也可能因共同暴露而同时陷入困境。",en:"Adrian and Brunnermeier move from standalone VaR to the system's loss distribution when one institution is distressed. Large individual volatility need not imply strong system dependence, while several small firms may share the same exposure."},reference:{url:"https://www.newyorkfed.org/medialibrary/media/research/staff_reports/sr348.pdf",label:{zh:"2014年9月工作论文 · §1",en:"September 2014 staff report · §1"}}},{title:{zh:"差值需要一个正常状态基准",en:"The difference needs a median-state baseline"},body:{zh:"工作论文将困境状态下的系统CoVaR与该机构处于中位数状态时的系统CoVaR相减，得到ΔCoVaR。只报告困境条件下的一个分位数，会遗漏比较基准，也不能自动叫作风险贡献的变化。",en:"Delta CoVaR subtracts system CoVaR conditional on an institution's median state from system CoVaR conditional on its distress state. Reporting only the distressed conditional quantile omits the baseline and is not the same statistic."},reference:{url:"https://www.newyorkfed.org/medialibrary/media/research/staff_reports/sr348.pdf",label:{zh:"2014年9月工作论文 · §3.1",en:"September 2014 staff report · §3.1"}}},{title:{zh:"条件事件与正负号都是定义",en:"Conditioning and signs belong to the definition"},body:{zh:"第3.1节按损失定义分位数，并在ΔCoVaR公式中把机构损失固定在自身VaR或中位数。固定在阈值与落入整个尾部不是同一条件；若改用收益而非损失，分位方向和正负号也必须一并说明。",en:"Section 3.1 uses loss quantiles and evaluates the delta formula at the institution's VaR and median. Equality at a threshold is not conditioning on the entire tail. Switching from losses to returns also requires explicit quantile and sign conventions."},reference:{url:"https://www.newyorkfed.org/medialibrary/media/research/staff_reports/sr348.pdf",label:{zh:"2014年9月工作论文 · §3.1",en:"September 2014 staff report · §3.1"}}},{title:{zh:"交换条件，问题就变了",en:"Reversing the conditioning changes the question"},body:{zh:"系统在某家机构困境下的风险，与某家机构在系统危机下的风险，方向相反。作者把后一种称为Exposure-CoVaR。两者都研究尾部关系，却不能作为同一个指标互换，也不能仅靠相关系数的对称性混淆。",en:"System risk conditional on a firm's distress differs from firm risk conditional on system distress. The latter is called Exposure-CoVaR. These directional questions are not interchangeable simply because ordinary correlation is symmetric."},reference:{url:"https://www.newyorkfed.org/medialibrary/media/research/staff_reports/sr348.pdf",label:{zh:"2014年9月工作论文 · §3.4",en:"September 2014 staff report · §3.4"}}},{title:{zh:"共同暴露不等于因果传染",en:"Common exposure is not causal contagion"},body:{zh:"共同宏观冲击、相似持仓和机构之间的反馈，都可能形成尾部共同变化。作者明确将ΔCoVaR定位为简约统计工具，而不是因果分摊。要回答某家机构究竟导致多少额外损失，需要额外的模型或识别依据。",en:"Shared macro shocks, similar positions and feedback can all generate tail co-movement. The authors describe a reduced-form statistical tool, not a causal allocation. Identifying losses caused by a particular institution requires additional assumptions or identification."},reference:{url:"https://www.newyorkfed.org/medialibrary/media/research/staff_reports/sr348.pdf",label:{zh:"2014年9月工作论文 · §1; §3.3",en:"September 2014 staff report · §1; §3.3"}}},{title:{zh:"先固定样本与收益口径",en:"Fix the sample and return definition first"},body:{zh:"文中使用上市金融机构的周频股票收益，并区分百分比指标与乘入规模后的金额指标。编辑建议先保留机构身份、退市与合并处理、收益窗口及权重。下方复权教程只帮助准备价格，不提供系统组合、金融机构样本或CoVaR估计。",en:"The report uses weekly equity returns for listed financial institutions and distinguishes percentage measures from size-scaled amounts. Editorial application: retain identities, merger and delisting rules, windows and weights. The linked adjustment tutorial prepares prices only, not the system portfolio, institution sample or CoVaR estimator."},reference:{url:"https://www.newyorkfed.org/medialibrary/media/research/staff_reports/sr348.pdf",label:{zh:"2014年9月工作论文 · §1; §3.1",en:"September 2014 staff report · §1; §3.1"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读依据2014年9月工作论文，保留正式期刊的引用身份。尾部联动包含共同暴露，不能解释为某家机构造成了系统损失，也不是监管资本或投资建议。",en:"This guide uses the September 2014 staff report, separately from the final journal citation. Tail dependence includes common exposures; it does not identify losses caused by a firm or prescribe regulatory capital or investments."}};export{e as default};
